This mod is fixed at [sky[]]NORMAL[white[]] difficulty and cannot be changed.
[sky[]]Contains 55+[white[]] sectors!
All maps are Serpulo environment compatible.

[#c5cbff[]]Have fun[white[]].


Update log: V0.7 -- Stage 6-1 to 6-5 added. Multiple bugfixes, added more text hints in previous sectors.

